mage-2.5-flare` | Image 2.5 | OpenAI Images API | plugin 2K preset |\n| `g"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"pt-image-2.5-sunburst` | Image 2.5 | OpenAI Images API | plugin 2K preset |\n| `gemini-3.1-flash-imag"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"e` | Nano Banana | OpenAI Chat Completions | 1K / 2K / 4K |\n| `gemini-3-pro-image` | Nano Banana | O"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"penAI Chat Completions | 1K / 2K / 4K |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The two Image 2.5 IDs and Images API route were verified against the 88API live catalog on 2026-09-1"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"0. They reuse the plugin 2K size presets; this is not an upstream resolution limit. Select either ex"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"act ID for one call or save it as your default."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The factory default is `gpt-image-2`. A saved user default overrides it. A model supplied for one ge"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"neration overrides the default only for that call. The plugin never silently switches models, provid"},{"id":"p12s3","text":" the default only for that call. The plugin never silently switches models, providers, or protocols."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Install from GitHub into the profile you actually use:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"For DSH Desktop, replace `web` with the active Desktop profile name when needed. For reproducible in"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"stallations, pin a reviewed commit:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"This repository ships runnable JavaScript, so a GitHub install does not need a `prepare` build or pn"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"pm `allowBuilds` permission."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Verify the bundle layer before booting:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The dump should contain the `88api-image` row."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Configure the Key: recommended safe method"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Run this complete command:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"> **Do not paste the Key yet and do not replace any command text. This complete command only opens K"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ey setup; no part of it is the Key.**"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Follow these steps in order:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"1. Run the complete `dsh plugin --profile web exec 88api-image set-key` command unchanged, then pres"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"s Enter once.\n2. Wait for the terminal to display `88API Key:` on a separate line.\n3. Only then past"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"e the real Key and press Enter again. Hidden input is expected."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"`dsh plugin` invokes plugin management, `--profile web` selects the profile, `exec` runs an installe"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"d command, `88api-image` is this plugin's CLI, and `set-key` enters Key setup mode. Replace only `we"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"b` when a different profile is active; never replace `88api-image`, `set-key`, or another command pa"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"ent profile is active; never replace `88api-image`, `set-key`, or another command part with the Key."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"After running it, the terminal displays `88API Key:`. Paste the real Key only at that prompt and pre"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"ss Enter. Input is hidden and the complete Key does not enter the command-line arguments."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"For non-interactive setup, pipe the Key through standard input:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Inspect the masked configuration:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"The default config file is `~/.dsh/88api-image/config.json`. `API88_KEY` overrides the saved Key wit"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"hout writing it to disk. Never commit, paste into an issue, or pass a real Key as a command-line arg"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"riting it to disk. Never commit, paste into an issue, or pass a real Key as a command-line argument."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Configure the Key: ask the Agent to do it"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"A beginner may say:"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"The Agent calls `image_key_88api` with `action=set`; the result contains only a masked preview such "},{"id":"p38s2","text":"age_key_88api` with `action=set`; the result contains only a masked preview such as `abcdef...1234`."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"**Privacy warning:** this is convenient, but a Key sent to the Agent may remain in DSH conversation "},{"id":"p39s2","text":"and tool-call history. Hidden terminal input is recommended for long-term personal use. If a Key was"},{"id":"p39s3","text":" posted in chat, consider deleting that session or rotating the Key in the 88api.ai console afterwar"},{"id":"p39s4","text":"osted in chat, consider deleting that session or rotating the Key in the 88api.ai console afterward."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## Choose and change the default model"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"Ask the agent in natural language:"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"Or set it from the terminal:"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"The Agent may call `set_default` only when the user explicitly asks for a long-term change. Ordinary"},{"id":"p45s2","text":" generations omit the model and use the saved default exactly."},{"id":"p46s1","text":"## Generation and editing"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"`image_generate_88api` accepts:"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"- one `prompt`, optionally repeated with `count` from 1 to 4;\n- or `prompts`, up to 20 different seq"},{"id":"p48s2","text":"uential paid requests;\n- an optional explicit `model` for one call;\n- `aspect` and provider-valid `r"},{"id":"p48s3","text":"esolution`;\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"## Security model"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"DSH plugins run as trusted local code in the Host process; capability metadata is not a sandbox. Rev"},{"id":"p50s2","text":"iew the source and pin a commit before installation. This plugin:"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"- keeps DSH core packages as peer dependencies to avoid duplicate Cordis/tool runtimes;\n- stores the"},{"id":"p51s2","text":" Key with restrictive file permissions where the platform supports them;\n- masks the Key in all summ"},{"id":"p51s3","text":"aries;\n- caps reference and response bytes;\n- requires HTTPS for the API base URL unless a deploymen"},{"id":"p51s4","text":"t explicitly opts into an insecure local test endpoint;\n- refuses non-HTTPS, local, or private-netwo"},{"id":"p51s5","text":"rk image URLs returned by an upstream response;\n- does not send the Key to redirected or third-party"},{"id":"p51s6","text":" returned by an upstream response;\n- does not send the Key to redirected or third-party image hosts."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

